{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snowflake Master is your chance to show how to make snowflakes out of paper. There are no limits - just you and your imagination! Save your unique masterpieces and build up a collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496440/extras/DescriptionImage2.png?t=1739994059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can try different shapes and colors to bring your idea to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496440/extras/DescriptionUnique1.png?t=1739994059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if you just want to relax, there's a library of ready-made patterns for you to repeat. Try it and see how a piece of paper makes beautiful snowflakes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496440/extras/DescriptionPattern2.png?t=1739994059\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Snowflake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496440/bf27dc53fa470c379d06e7c0ebbd31c39f7aeb9c.jpg"},{"name":"Snowflaker Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496440/b43b222684520a2d2d88698ee6a3bfb9b9888e96.jpg"},{"name":"Snowflake Intermediate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496440/a7422a9a5885ed9fc032201f602c6b8b7277b65e.jpg"},{"name":"Snowflake Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496440/5c33c32fbd8381cc3b0e8c89ad213f22d9459ee1.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496440?t=1739994059